  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)- Wapa PPE and Garment Production Training Project 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LSETF- Wapa PPE and Garment Production Training Project 2 will address youth unemployment in Lagos by improving job skills and employment outcomes in the garment production sector. The project will offer a four-week program for 310 women aged 18-25 years old.</narrative>
  </description>
